<title>ESTONIA: CENTRAL BANK FIXINGS MAY  20/21.</title>
<headline>CENTRAL BANK FIXINGS MAY  20/21.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Estonian central bank</p>
<p>released the following fixings for the Estonian kroon for May</p>
<p>20/21. The Estonian kroon is pegged at eight kroons to a German</p>
<p>mark.</p>
<p>	    May 20/21	 May 19/20</p>
<p> CZK	0.44341	    0.44344</p>
<p> DKK	2.10154	    2.10033</p>
<p> FIM	2.65508	    2.65424</p>
<p> HUF	0.07497	    0.07496</p>
<p> JPY	0.11937	    0.1168</p>
<p> LTL	3.3902	     3.3881</p>
<p> LVL     23.95266	   23.8284</p>
<p> RUR	0.00236	    0.00235</p>
<p> SEK	1.78781	    1.77862</p>
<p> UAH	7.34107	    7.34747</p>
<p> USD     13.5608	    13.5524</p>
<p> XEU     15.6295	    15.6144</p>
<p>For a full listing see Bank of Estonia </p>
<p>--Tallinn newsroom, +372 630 8400 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
